{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12694","headline":"送孟校书往南海 · 元结","name":"送孟校书往南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾闻近南海，乃是魑魅乡。\n忽见孟夫子，欢然游此方。\n忽喜海风来，海帆又欲张。\n漂漂随所去，不念归路长。\n君有失母儿，爱之似阿阳。\n始解随人行，不欲离君傍。\n相劝早旋归，此言慎勿忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}